      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Doctor, please, my husband, he ate prawns, and now his lips are swelling, and he's coming out in hives!",
      "start_timestamp": "00:01",
      "end_timestamp": "00:11",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Peter. My lips feel huge. And my throat's a bit tight.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:25",
      "end_timestamp": "00:31",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "When did you eat the prawns?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:33",
      "end_timestamp": "00:37",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Twenty minutes ago. A prawn curry, at the Thai place.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:40",
      "end_timestamp": "00:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It doesn't matter exactly, we're acting now. Any trouble breathing?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:59",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. Not really. I'm fine, I can breathe.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:08",
      "end_timestamp": "01:13",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "He's wheezing, doctor, listen to him.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:15",
      "end_timestamp": "01:19",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any allergies to medicines or other foods, as far as you know?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:36",
      "end_timestamp": "01:43",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "None. I've never had any.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:45",
      "end_timestamp": "01:48",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse 112, blood pressure 102 over 60, oxygen 95 percent, temperature 36.8, respiratory rate 22.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:16",
      "end_timestamp": "02:25",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your lips and tongue are swollen, there are raised red hives over your chest and arms, and I can hear a wheeze in your chest.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:04",
      "end_timestamp": "03:16",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, it's what we call anaphylaxis, a severe reaction to the prawns. We're treating it now.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:23",
      "end_timestamp": "03:33",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Nurse, I want you to give adrenaline, intramuscular, point five of a milligram, into his thigh, now. And oxygen, and a drip.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:39",
      "end_timestamp": "03:50",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, please, hold his hand. I'm also going to give an antihistamine and a steroid by injection, and we'll keep you in for at least six hours, to watch for a second reaction.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:14",
      "end_timestamp": "04:29",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "clinical_actions[2]",
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I'd like a blood test for tryptase, which shows the reaction, and a repeat set of observations every fifteen minutes.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:36",
      "end_timestamp": "04:47",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Peter, don't eat or drink anything, and tell the nurse if your breathing worsens.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:54",
      "end_timestamp": "05:01",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[4]"
      ]
